To create libraries for a given machine type,

From this directory:
make clean
make util
make io
make jipfit

Determine the OS and the machine type from unix/Linux:
unix% uname -s
Linux
unix% uname -m
i686

MAKE A DIRECTORY FOR THIS OS/MACHINE IF ONE DOES NOT EXIST: "OS-machine"
unix% mkdir Linux-i686

COPY OR MOVE THE LIBRARIES INTO THIS DIRECTORY:
mv lib*.a Linux-i686
